One year has passed since the one they call the Scourge from the West came and single-handedly destroyed most of the Orc 
Prides. The Sunwall, now possessing a Farportal, has entered an economic and millitary pact with the Allied Kingdoms in the 
west and conquered most of Var'Eyal. The few remnants of the Prides are caged. But by chance or fate the Scourge missed the Kruk Pride, which now stands as the only orc settlement left. Isolated on an island they too however face impending doom. Besieged by the Sunwall they are barred from entering the mainland and on their own island they are at war with a technologically advanced civilization of giants. Their only hope is to reverse-engineer their steam-powered technology and bring metal mayhem to all the foes of the Pride.

Features:
- Explore a whole new campaign from level 1 to 50, set one year after the Maj'Eyal campaign in the Far East. The Sunwall has taken over; your own Pride is under threat from the steam giants. And maybe things are even worse than they seem.

- Risk your life in over 20 new unique zones. You love ritches, don't you?

- Play as one of the three new races: Orcs, Yetis and Whitehooves. Discover their stories, their pains and their hopes. And their awesome racial powers!

- Master steam technology to build powerful tinkers to augment your equipment. Need to close in? Equip your rocket boots! Need one more hand? Use a weapon automaton! If you have a problem, steamtech has a (usualy explosive) solution! Learn over 80 crafts: your new name is Versalitity

- Play as one of the three new Tinker classes: Gunslingers, Sawbutchers and Psyshots! Harness the power of heavy steamy metal to bring fiery doom to your foes. Eletrocute them to death, burn them, maw them down; but in style!

- Master the tactical uses of over 140 talents!

- Use technology for fun: plant bombs to destroy tunnels, shred your way through sand and discover others are also doing it. Better.

- Infusions and runes are for puny humans; strap on a few medical injectors and directly inject experimental combat salves into your body!

- Loot over 70 new powerful artifacts. Ever dreamed of cutting down your foes with huge rotating saws? Ever wanted to dual wield steamguns? Ever dared strap a rocket on your back and call it a jetpack? Now you can!

- Die a the hands (or claws, jaws, guns, ...) of over 140 new creatures

- Earn a new trunkload of achievements!

- Read tons of new lore to immerse yourself into the world. Feel pity for your foes, feel hatred for your foes.

- Lament that you can not play your classic classes in Embers of Rage or the new classes in the default campaign. And then discover that you CAN!
